{{!
    @template tool_vae/pdf_blocks

    A piece of the printable copy of a dossier (dossier.pdf in the archive): the HTML that tool_vae\local\pdf_renderer hands
    to TCPDF, drawn block by block. It is not a page of the site: nothing here is shown in a browser.

    Each block sets one kind and leaves the others false: a heading of level 1 to 4 (h1 to h4), a paragraph (p), a paragraph in
    italics (note), a rule (hr), a table of label and value pairs (table), a list (list), or text that is already HTML (html).
    Every text is given plain and escaped once here. Three keys are HTML made elsewhere (triple braces): the value of a row of
    the table (already escaped, or made by the core), the narrative of the vaeiste (format_text(), then cleaned of every tag
    that is not text markup and of every attribute), and the body of an attestation (escaped, line breaks kept).

    The table is laid out by TCPDF on two columns. The widths and the padding of its cells are given by the style attribute,
    which TCPDF reads as it reads the attributes width and cellpadding that HTML 5 no longer has: the two drawings are the same
    (checked on the content of the pages).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * blocks - array of blocks, each with every key below set to false but one:
      * h1, h2, h3, h4, p, note - object: text - string, plain
      * hr - object: text - string, empty
      * table - object: rows - array of label - string, plain, and valuehtml - string, HTML
      * html - object: text - string, HTML
      * list - object: items - array of items; each sets plain (object: text) or signed (object: role, bodyhtml, text), the other false

    Example context (json):
    {
        "blocks": [
            {"h1": {"text": "Dossier of Camille Durand"}, "h2": false, "h3": false, "h4": false, "p": false, "note": false,
             "hr": false, "table": false, "html": false, "list": false},
            {"h1": false, "h2": false, "h3": false, "h4": false, "p": false, "note": false, "hr": false,
             "table": {"rows": [{"label": "Archive", "valuehtml": "01ABC"}, {"label": "Platform", "valuehtml": "A site - https://example.org"}]},
             "html": false, "list": false},
            {"h1": false, "h2": {"text": "RS00000 - A record of certification"}, "h3": false, "h4": false, "p": false, "note": false,
             "hr": false, "table": false, "html": false, "list": false},
            {"h1": false, "h2": false, "h3": {"text": "RS00000-C01 - Help with the meals"}, "h4": false, "p": false, "note": false,
             "hr": false, "table": false, "html": false, "list": false},
            {"h1": false, "h2": false, "h3": false, "h4": false, "p": false, "note": false, "hr": false, "table": false,
             "html": {"text": "<p>I prepare the meals with the team.</p>"}, "list": false},
            {"h1": false, "h2": false, "h3": false, "h4": false, "p": false, "note": false, "hr": false, "table": false,
             "html": false,
             "list": {"items": [
                 {"plain": {"text": "An attestation withdrawn on 3 November 2026."}, "signed": false},
                 {"plain": false, "signed": {"role": "Manager, a care home", "bodyhtml": "I read the account.", "text": "Attested on 4 November 2026."} }
             ] } }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#blocks}}{{#h1}}<h1>{{text}}</h1>{{/h1}}{{!
}}{{#h2}}<h2>{{text}}</h2>{{/h2}}{{!
}}{{#h3}}<h3>{{text}}</h3>{{/h3}}{{!
}}{{#h4}}<h4>{{text}}</h4>{{/h4}}{{!
}}{{#p}}<p>{{text}}</p>{{/p}}{{!
}}{{#note}}<p><em>{{text}}</em></p>{{/note}}{{!
}}{{#hr}}<hr />{{/hr}}{{!
}}{{#table}}<table style="padding: 2px">{{#rows}}<tr><td style="width: 35%"><strong>{{label}}</strong></td><td style="width: 65%">{{{valuehtml}}}</td></tr>{{/rows}}</table>{{/table}}{{!
}}{{#html}}{{{text}}}{{/html}}{{!
}}{{#list}}<ul>{{#items}}<li>{{#plain}}{{text}}{{/plain}}{{#signed}}<strong>{{role}}</strong><br />{{{bodyhtml}}}<br />{{text}}{{/signed}}</li>{{/items}}</ul>{{/list}}{{!
}}{{/blocks}}
